# Client rendering: every page answers the same shell (docs/compiler/server.md §7).

### a page answers the HTML shell
GET /board
>>> 200
content-type: text/html; charset=utf-8
~ <!doctype html>
~ <html lang="en">
~ <script type="module" src="/assets/

### the shell has the app-wide metadata, not the page's
GET /board
>>> 200
~ <title>Client App</title>
!~ Board page title

### the server runs no loads and renders no view under client rendering
GET /board
>>> 200
!~ LOADED-ON-THE-SERVER
!~ "loads"

### an unknown path is still a 404
GET /nowhere
>>> 404
